    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 38；''重伤'' 19</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 14，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 13</span><span>''侦查'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 8</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+7vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+5 伤害，对倒地目标则为 2d6+5 伤害。若该狼对目标有战斗优势，则目标倒地。效果：该狼快步最多四格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 13（+2）</span><span>''敏捷'' 16（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 13（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 2（-3）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
